00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:09.480
How to create Douyin account. So if you want to&nbsp;
create a Douyin account then what you need to do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:13.240
is first you just need simply open up your&nbsp;
browser any browser that you're comfortable with.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:18.520
After that search for doin. You can also go with&nbsp;
your application if you want to or just simply go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:22.320
with [www.douyin.com](https://www.douyin.com) and&nbsp;
you will be able to create an account from your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.280
browser as well. Once you're on the application&nbsp;
or once you're on the browser of doin.com,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:32.360
you need to go with login which will be in the top&nbsp;
right. And from here it will take you to this kind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:36.880
of interface. You can just simply use your phone&nbsp;
number or your password to create your account.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:41.280
So if you want to create a new account, you need&nbsp;
to make sure that you've selected use phone number&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:44.760
and then you need to enter your phone number with&nbsp;
your country code. After that, you need to go with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:49.200
send code which will be right here and you'll&nbsp;
receive a verification code. You need to enter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:54.040
that verification code and then just simply go&nbsp;
with login. And if you don't have an account with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:58.400
that phone number that you've entered, then it&nbsp;
will directly take you to the create account page.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:03.200
And from there, you'll be able to create your&nbsp;
account. You can enter your password. And that's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:07.680
it. And if you have any questions, feel free&nbsp;
to comment below. Thanks. Thanks for watching.

